description	"Rebel Honor Guard 

Loyal Multilife Bodyguards who swore an oath to protect their allies.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Rebel Electropole (Red/Blue)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- Staggers/Electrifies on hit
-- 30% less Reach
-- 167% more Radius
- Medpack
- Smoke Grenade
-- Obscures vision on det, 99.9% less Dmg, 40% faster RoF

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Assemble (3)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Ammo Pack (Dispenser)
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Dodge (1) ^3[CS2]
- Grappling Hook (1) ^3[CS4 Melee]"
